        "x1": 188.8,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "Red tape"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.5,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 321.5,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Characteristics of bureaucratic language"
      },
      {
        "y": 117.4,
        "x0": 106.8,
        "x1": 428.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A STUDENT SHALL NOT BE ELIGIBLE FOR A LOAN IN RELATION TO AN ACADEMIC YEAR IF HE/SHE:"
      },
      {
        "y": 130.2,
        "x0": 113.8,
        "x1": 338.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(a) has attained the age of 50 years before the first day of the course;"
      },
      {
        "y": 132.2,
        "x0": 172.2,
        "x1": 174,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1"
      },
      {
        "y": 144.4,
        "x0": 113.8,
        "x1": 327.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(b) has received another loan in relation to the same academic year;"
      },
      {
        "y": 157.1,
        "x0": 113.8,
        "x1": 490.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(c) has received another loan in relation to another academic year which began during the same period 1st August to the"
      },
      {
        "y": 165.5,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 308.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "following 31st July during which the academic year began;"
      },
      {
        "y": 178.1,
        "x0": 113.8,
        "x1": 260.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(d) is eligible in respect of that year to receive:"
      },
      {
        "y": 189.8,
        "x0": 127.8,
        "x1": 503.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(i) any payment under a bursary or award of similar description bestowed on him/her under section 63 of the Health"
      },
      {
        "y": 191.8,
        "x0": 377.3,
        "x1": 379.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2"
      },
      {
        "y": 199.8,
        "x0": 138,
        "x1": 476.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Services and Public Health Act 1968(2) the amount of which is not calculated by reference to his/her income."
      },
      {
        "y": 219.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 180.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1reached 2given to"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.1,
        "x0": 420.3,
        "x1": 505.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Reply Forward"
      },
      {
        "y": 263.4,
        "x0": 110.3,
        "x1": 509.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Your request to demolish1 the garage adjoining2 your property is hereby rejected. Any and all appeals regarding this decision"
      },
      {
        "y": 273,
        "x0": 110.3,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "must be submitted to the undersigned3 by Jan 31 2018. No exceptions to the aforementioned4 procedure will be considered."
      },
      {
        "y": 299.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 414.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1knock down 2next to 3the person who wrote this letter 4mentioned earlier"
      },
      {
        "y": 315.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some publications produced by companies or government departments are difficult to understand"
      },
      {
        "y": 327.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 396,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "because they use language that is very different from everyday English."
      },
      {
        "y": 339.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 477.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• They frequently use words that are longer and ‘grander’ than their ordinary equivalents."
      },
      {
        "y": 351.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• They often use a passive form instead of an active one, e.g. ‘Normal service will be resumed as"
      },
      {
        "y": 363.1,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 443.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "soon as possible’ instead of ‘We will resume normal service as soon as possible.’"
      },
      {
        "y": 375.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• They use nouns as the subject of the sentence when they are not necessary, e.g. ‘Achievement"
      },
      {
        "y": 387.1,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 507.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of this module is dependent upon candidates meeting the assessment outcomes’ instead of ‘To"
      },
      {
        "y": 399.1,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 406.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "achieve this module, candidates must meet the assessment outcomes.’"
      },
      {
        "y": 411.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 493.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• They use a noun instead of You, e.g. Customers will be informed of …’ instead of ‘You will be"
      },
      {
        "y": 423.1,
        "x0": 110.6,
        "x1": 313.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "informed of …’ or even ‘We will tell you about …’"
      },
      {
        "y": 439.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 338.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "These words are more frequent in a bureaucratic context:"
      },
      {
        "y": 451,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 350.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Work will commence in May. [start] (noun = commencement)"
      },
      {
        "y": 463,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 438.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The company ceased operations last year. [stopped functioning] (noun = cessation)"
      },
      {
        "y": 475,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 514.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Property belonging to the deceased will be returned to the next of kin. [dead person] [closest relative]"
      },
      {
        "y": 487,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 305.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In the event of an emergency, call 121. [if there is]"
      },
      {
        "y": 499,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 449,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In the event of fire, the building must be evacuated immediately. [people must leave]"
      },
      {
        "y": 511,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 397.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Tenants must endeavour to keep communal areas tidy at all times. [try]"
      },
      {
        "y": 523,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 457.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The developments will facilitate movement of traffic in the area. [make possible, easier]"
      },
      {
        "y": 535,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 441,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Residents will be instructed what to do in the event of an emergency. [will be told]"
      },
      {
        "y": 547,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 340,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The project will proceed to the next phase in June. [move]"
      },
      {
        "y": 559,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 356.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "We are currently attempting to rectify the situation. [put right]"
      },
      {
        "y": 571,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 366.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Normal service will be resumed as soon as possible. [start again]"
      },
      {
        "y": 592.3,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 260.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Bureaucratic correspondence"
      },
      {
        "y": 610.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 402.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "There is some specific vocabulary that characterises bureaucratic letters:"
      },
      {
        "y": 621.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 403.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Please acknowledge receipt of payment. [inform us that you have received]"
      },
      {
        "y": 633.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 486.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "With the compliments of Smith and Co. [written on a slip of paper sent with an item from a company]"
      },
      {
        "y": 645.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 362.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Please notify us immediately of any change of address. [inform]"
      },
      {
        "y": 657.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 430.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I would be grateful for a reply at your earliest convenience. [as soon as possible]"
      },
      {
        "y": 669.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 424.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Contact us if further clarification is required. [you need more of an explanation]"
      },
      {
        "y": 681.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 349,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I enclose payment in respect of your invoice. [relating to, for]"
      },
      {
        "y": 693.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 330.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I am writing with regard to your advertisement. [about]"
      }
